    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44577" root="&#xA;                        وسم&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِمَةٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A brand,</i> or <i>mark</i> or <i>figure made with a
hot iron, upon an animal.</i> (K.) And <i>i. q.</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَامَةٌ</span> [<i>A mark, sign, badge, token, symptom,</i>
&amp;c.]. (Msb.) And The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُلْوَان</span> [or <i>title</i>] of a
book or writing. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">علو</span>.) See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِيمَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِيمَى</span> in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سوم</span>.

